<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Carnival Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Carnival Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Carnival Corp as outperform.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $43 a share.</p>
<p>-- said expects Carnival to earn $2.14 a share in 1997 and $2.40 a share in 1998.</p>
